 a private limited company registered in Søreidgrend, founded 2009-12-10. TORSET HOLDING AS invests in other companies, mainly within IT and telecom, and its registered activities include consulting in IT and telecom companies (advice, project management, carrying out assignments and other IT services). Its statutory purpose also covers implementation, development and sale of IT solutions, and participation in other companies with similar activities. Its main industry code is 62.200: computer consultancy and computer facilities management activities. In its 2025 accounts, total operating income was 1 825 553 NOK and the annual result was 467 581 NOK; operating income was up from 1 762 459 NOK in 2024. The annual result rose from 356 378 NOK in 2024 to 467 581 NOK in 2025. Equity rose from 2 251 277 NOK in 2024 to 2 718 858 NOK in 2025. Registered leadership: Arvid Torset (daglig leder and styrets leder). The register's most recent update was on 2026-05-21 (sisteInnsendteAarsregnskap).","sentences":[{"text":"TORSET HOLDING AS is a private limited company registered in Søreidgrend, founded 2009-12-10.","claim_ids":["c1","c3","c5","c6"]},{"text":"TORSET HOLDING AS invests in other companies, mainly within IT and telecom, and its registered activities include consulting in IT and telecom companies (advice, project management, carrying out assignments and other IT services). Its statutory purpose also covers implementation, development and sale of IT solutions, and participation in other companies with similar activities.","claim_ids":["c10","c9"]},{"text":"Its main industry code is 62.200: computer consultancy and computer facilities management activities.","claim_ids":["c4"]},{"text":"In its 2025 accounts, total operating income was 1 825 553 NOK and the annual result was 467 581 NOK; operating income was up from 1 762 459 NOK in 2024.","claim_ids":["c52","c57","c41"]},{"text":"The annual result rose from 356 378 NOK in 2024 to 467 581 NOK in 2025.","claim_ids":["c46",